### 1. Create a Leave Request (POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/leaves
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": 101,
  "leaveType": "SICK",
  "startDate": "2026-10-15",
  "endDate": "2026-10-17",
  "reason": "Flu"
}

### 2. Get All Leave Requests (GET)
GET http://localhost:8080/leaves

### 3. Get Leave Request by ID (GET)
GET http://localhost:8080/leaves/1

### 4. Update Leave Request (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:8080/leaves/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": 101,
  "leaveType": "SICK",
  "startDate": "2026-10-15",
  "endDate": "2026-10-20",
  "reason": "Flu extended",
  "status": "APPROVED"
}

### 5. Delete Leave Request (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/leaves/1